# A frozen save fixture is bytes, not text.
#
# The framing separator is a single 0x0A. This repository is developed on
# Windows with core.autocrlf=true, which would rewrite that byte to 0x0D 0x0A on
# checkout — changing the payload length, breaking the CRC32C, and turning a
# fixture that is supposed to be immutable forever into one that differs per
# machine. Marking it binary is what makes "frozen" true across clones.
*.save binary
